IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CONDS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SCORE PIC 9(3) VALUE 85.
    88 PASSED VALUE 50 THRU 100.
    88 FAILED VALUE 0 THRU 49.
01 WS-GRADE PIC X(1).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    IF WS-SCORE >= 90
        MOVE "A" TO WS-GRADE
    ELSE
        IF WS-SCORE >= 80
            MOVE "B" TO WS-GRADE
        ELSE
            MOVE "C" TO WS-GRADE
        END-IF
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-GRADE.
    IF PASSED AND NOT FAILED
        DISPLAY "PASSED"
    END-IF.
    IF WS-SCORE > 100 OR WS-SCORE < 0
        DISPLAY "IMPOSSIBLE"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "IN RANGE"
    END-IF.
    MOVE 40 TO WS-SCORE.
    IF FAILED
        DISPLAY "FAILED"
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.
